{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e13727b2ec77de2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Serving Runtimes\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: Serving Runtimes\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: RHOAI Serving\n6\t**Upstream**: vllm-project/vllm, openvinotoolkit/model_server, caikit/caikit\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/vllm, red-hat-data-services/vllm\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tProductized model runtimes executed under KServe InferenceServices: vLLM (LLM\n13\tserving, the default GenAI runtime), OpenVINO Model Server, and Caikit. Runtime\n14\timages are built and released per platform version; only CUDA (NVIDIA) builds\n15\tare currently productized — ROCm and Gaudi builds exist upstream but are not\n16\tshipped or supported.\n17\t\n18\t## Dependencies\n19\t\n20\t- KServe for lifecycle and routing (ServingRuntime CRD)\n21\t- NVIDIA GPU Operator for accelerator discovery on supported hardware\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- ServingRuntime / ClusterServingRuntime CRDs (serving.kserve.io)\n26\t- OpenAI-compatible endpoints exposed by vLLM-based runtimes\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5bada63446137aa","agent_id":"ae375e71e6ea8f29e","session_id":"83c98df4-c9fc-48fe-b897-027eac3b0312","uuid":"74e7e660-c323-4975-821f-72a437dc8b40","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:22:03.598Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e13727b2ec77de2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020 into epics"}
